    description: Some("Imperial Walkers are crossing the Ice Planet Hoth toward the Rebel power generator, and your Snowspeeder is all that slows them. The battlefield runs eight screens wide, so a radar band tracks all five Walkers while you fight whichever one is on screen. When the lead Walker reaches the generator, the game ends."),
